{"id":"db07d4693484f246","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low-ce-generate.md","title":"低 c.e. 度生成全部 c.e. 度","display":"thm-low-ce-generate — 低 c.e. 度生成全部 c.e. 度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low-ce-generate","aliases":["20-thm-low-ce-generate"],"display":"thm-low-ce-generate — 低 c.e. 度生成全部 c.e. 度","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.4","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low-ce-generate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low-ce-generate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low-ce-generate — 低 c.e. 度生成全部 c.e. 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}ce\\text{-}generate}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}ce\\text{-}generate}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非零情形由分裂推论；零度可取两边皆零。低 c.e. 度族因此通常不在 join 下封闭。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.4；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ambos-split]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ambos-split]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low\\text{-}ce\\text{-}generate}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf b=\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1].","display":true}],"bytes":1055,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9b28c9ef17c93bd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-ce-generate]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。"}],"outgoing":["1013cc25d82f1ed8","f389bdba28de0478"]}